From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lufrz <314570110+lufrz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:12:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: skip the current platform compatibility test

When PLATFORM_SEPOLICY_VERSION is 202604, this is the current exported API,
not a previous API in PLATFORM_SEPOLICY_COMPAT_VERSIONS. The 202604 mapping
is generated from current policy, rather than the historical compatibility
files used by treble_sepolicy_tests_202604.

Match this version regardless of ASAN and neverallow settings, just as the
existing guards on plat_202604.cil and 202604.compat.cil already do. Keep
all previous-version tests and all enforcement checks enabled.
---
 Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -1258,7 +1258,7 @@ phony {
         product_variable("selinux_ignore_neverallows"),
     ), {
-        ("202604", true, true): [],
+        ("202604", default, default): [],
         (default, true, true): [],
         (default, default, default): [
             "treble_sepolicy_tests_202604",
         ],
